<title>USA: Dynatech sees charge from Telxon deal.</title>
<headline>Dynatech sees charge from Telxon deal.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynatech Corp said Monday it would take a one-time, non-cash charge in the current quarter for the acquisition of Telxon Corp's Itronix unit.</p>
<p>The company did not specify what the charge would be, and Dynatech officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>Dynatech said it had completed the acquisition of Itronix for about $65 million cash.</p>
<p>It said the purchase would be non-dilutive, excluding the charge for write-off of purchased incomplete technology.  </p>
<p>Later, a Dynatech spokeswoman said the company had not yet estimated the size of the charge.</p>
